    "summary": "Use it as your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) begins, and pick units of yours, either:\n\n- up to 2 **DRUKHARI BATTLELINE** units\n- 1 other **DRUKHARI** unit\n\nYou may spend 1 [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). For the rest of the phase, attacks by models in the picked units get +1 to **[Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)** against a **Below Half-strength** enemy unit, and +1 to **[Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** as well if you spent the Pain token.",
